[center][size=6][b][color=#d4af37]Guardian Calculation Assistant[/color][/b][/size]
[size=3][color=#b8b8b8]Stop guessing who should raise your heir. See the real odds.[/color][/size]

[size=2][color=#9a9a9a]Crusader Kings III 1.19  |  UI mod  |  Save-game safe  |  English & Portuguese (BR)[/color][/size][/center]

[line]

[center][size=4][b][color=#d4af37]What it does[/color][/b][/size][/center]

Picking a guardian in vanilla means eyeballing skills and hoping. [b]GCA[/b] puts a number on every candidate: the actual chance that the child gains education progress with that guardian, computed with [b]the same formula the game uses[/b].

[center][size=5][b][color=#7fc8f8]GCA 64%  ~R3[/color][/b][/size]
[size=2][color=#9a9a9a]64% chance of +2 education points every birthday  |  projected rank 3 at adulthood[/color][/size][/center]

[line]

[center][size=4][b][color=#d4af37]Features[/color][/b][/size][/center]

[size=3][b][color=#e8c766]GCA score on every candidate[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Shown in [b]Educate Child[/b], [b]Offer Guardianship[/b] and [b]Offer Ward[/b].
[*]Works both ways: rate guardians for a child, or children for a guardian.
[*]Hover for the full breakdown: every factor, the point projection and the notes that apply to the pair.
[/list]

[size=3][b][color=#e8c766]Find guardians beyond your court[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*]New [b]Find Guardian (GCA)[/b] interaction on any child at your court.
[*]Searches your court [b]and every court in your diplomatic range[/b].
[*]Pick someone and click [i]Continue[/i]: the right vanilla interaction opens already filled in ([i]Educate Child[/i] for your court, [i]Offer Ward[/i] for foreign courts).
[/list]

[size=3][b][color=#e8c766]Sorted by score[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*]The search opens with the [b]best guardian on top[/b].
[*][b]GCA: by score[/b] and [b]Default list[/b] buttons sit under the native sort dropdown, which stays available.
[/list]

[size=3][b][color=#e8c766]Intellect filter[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Quick / Intelligent / Genius[/b] checkboxes to cut the list down instantly.
[*]The native [i]Traits[/i] filter is added to the filter panel too.
[/list]

[size=3][b][color=#e8c766]Smart notes[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Beacon of Learning bonus, Pedagogy perk, commander trait transfer, Knighthood.
[*]Different faith or culture (the ward only converts if you choose that option).
[/list]

[line]

[center][size=4][b][color=#d4af37]Why trust the number?[/color][/b][/size][/center]

GCA mirrors the vanilla education roll that runs on every birthday from 6 to 15. It reads the game's own factors, so overhaul mods that retune them are followed automatically.

[spoiler]
[b]Progress (+2 points in the focus)[/b]
[list]
[*]Base: 60
[*]Child's intellect: Genius +20 / Intelligent +15 / Quick or Shrewd +10
[*]Childhood trait matching / opposing the focus: +20 / -20
[*]Guardian's intellect: Genius +15 / Intelligent +10 / Quick or Shrewd +5
[*]Guardian's skill in the focus x 0.4
[*]Guardian's learning x 0.2
[*]Guardian's house aspiration (improved educator outcome): +5
[/list]

[b]No progress[/b]
[list]
[*]Base: 40
[*]Child: Imbecile or Inbred +20 / Stupid +15 / Slow or Dull +10
[*]Guardian: Imbecile +15 / Stupid +10 / Slow or Dull +5
[/list]

[b]Chance = progress / (progress + no progress)[/b]

[b]Vanilla quirks kept as they are[/b]
[list]
[*]Cultures with "better ward education" (Storytellers and similar) [i]replace[/i] the guardian's intellect and skill bonus with a flat +10. GCA reproduces this and warns you.
[*]No focus yet: the guardian's best skill is assumed.
[*]Projected rank uses the vanilla cut-offs (7 / 12 / 17 points). ~R4 means rank 4 or 5.
[*]The projection only counts the birthday rolls; events, tutors and universities can add more.
[/list]
[/spoiler]

[line]

[center][size=4][b][color=#d4af37]Installation[/color][/b][/size][/center]

[list=1]
[*]Download the zip from the [b]Files[/b] tab.
[*]Extract it into [i]Documents/Paradox Interactive/Crusader Kings III/mod/[/i]. You should see [i]guardian_calc_assistant.mod[/i] next to the [i]guardian_calc_assistant[/i] folder.
[*]Enable it in the launcher.
[/list]

Safe to add to or remove from an existing save.

[line]

[center][size=4][b][color=#d4af37]Compatibility[/color][/b][/size][/center]

[list]
[*][b]Game version:[/b] 1.19
[*][b]Overrides:[/b] [i]gui/interaction_confirmation.gui[/i]. Conflicts with other mods that override that same file.
[*][b]Marriage Calculation Assistant:[/b] compatible.
[*]The list row inherits whatever row your playset uses, so other UI mods' tweaks are kept.
[/list]

